{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30153","headline":"句 · 刘得仁","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外家虽是帝，当路且无亲。\n白日只如哭，黄泉免恨无。\n身闲甘旨下，白发太平人。\n同游芳草寺，见示白云诗。\n犹祈啓金口，一爲动文权。\n深山寺路千层石，竹杖椶鞋便可登。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}